00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:49.670
And Linda wrote in and said, Actually, Linda
and or John, it says both names.

00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:57.520
And they say, according to Genesis 129, mankind
and animals were originally vegetarians.

00:00:57.520 --> 00:00:59.570
