00:01:38.869 --> 00:01:43.639
So now, now God is directing what animals
eat.

00:01:43.639 --> 00:01:48.200
The other counterpoint would be, Well, if
this all happened in the last five or 6000

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:55.040
years, there is, number one, no evidence that
currently carnivorous animals were ever vegetarian.

00:01:55.040 --> 00:02:01.219
And if the idea is they evolved from being
vegetarian to being carnivorous, 5000 years

00:02:01.219 --> 00:02:04.479
is not nearly enough time for that to happen
to all of those species.

00:02:04.479 --> 00:02:05.850
So that also doesn't make sense.

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:10.460
But I get that they don't believe in the evolution
piece anyway, so it all doesn't make sense.

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:15.960
Another email said, Well, on Noah's Ark, they
