00:02:18.770 --> 00:02:27.540
And that's why the the issue of the animals
that were alive being eaten isn't an issue,

00:02:27.540 --> 00:02:29.250
but there's no evidence of that.

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:31.210
Another one was they were all eating fish
eggs.

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:33.850
I've not seen any evidence of that.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:35.590
The other one I got was David.

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:40.100
There were two of each main species, so like
they were just two snakes.

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:44.970
